But minimized menu screen still not hidden; menuIsOpen returns true. If minimized and Esc -> close? Better expand maybe. But if game paused and menu minimized, Escape should perhaps close/resume? Hmm. We'll say Esc from minimized = expand. Fine.
However when game mode paused and pauseScreen visible but menu hidden, Esc resumes as before.
When menu visible and Enter, startGame currently, but maybe resume? Keep Enter = start new run. Fine.

