 banner('SHELTER', 'DOORS BARRED', 'You are protected while the walls hold.', '', 2);
 Sound.claim();
}
function leaveShelter(s) {
 game.inShelter=null;
 const a=Math.atan2(player.y-s.y, player.x-s.x)||Math.PI/2;
 player.x = s.x + Math.cos(a)*(s.radius+40)
 ...
 toast('OUTSIDE', ...)
}
```
But leaving position if player at center yields angle atan2(8,0)=PI/2, so exit at y+radius+40. Fine.
Also when switching active shelter away while inside: if claimShelter changes active? not while inside unless other. We can set inside false if active changes. In claimShelter after active set, if game.inShelter && game.inShelter !== s.id leave.
When shelter collapses in advanceChapter and player inside: leave.
When night end/dawn: inside remain? showDawn hides HUD dim; can leave after beginNextDay. Fine.
When dying/over: set inside null maybe.
When active shelter breached: still inside but damage full.

