``` 
const insideS = game.inShelter ? getActiveShelter() : null;
if (insideS) { set prompt leave; show; return; }
```
But need to update DOM prompt text. Do at start before compute; but we still need panelShelter = insideS. Simpler integrate with bestShelter logic:
  - Add if (game.inShelter) prompt = {kind:'shelter', target:getActiveShelter, action:'leave', text:'Leave shelter', d:0}; then skip node/wild.
